// ProjectDeliveryS601 — Sprint 601: Rank 4 of D0367: a green gate writes a receipt keyed on every input a guard can read, and the next run whose key is equal answers from it (dcGateAnswersFromItsReceipt, D0371). EXECUTE. 3 pts.
package ProjectDeliveryS601 {
    private import EngineElement::*;
    private import EngineWork::*;
    private import EngineVerification::*;
    private import EngineRelationships::*;

